FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Hound_of_Xoriat\" title=\"Hound of Xoriat\">Hound of Xoriat</a></b>, Raid Warded Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Equipment Healing Amplification +40</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Healing Amplification</a></b>: This effect amplifies all incoming positive energy healing by +40 (<a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a>). Includes spells, potions, and other effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Levik&#39;s_Defender\" title=\"Named item sets\">Levik's Defender</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Levik&#39;s_Defender\" title=\"Named item sets\">Levik's Defender</a>:</b> With 2 items equipped - +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to AC, 20% Additional Melee Threat, Unlisted Fortitude and Will Save +1 (Stacks with most but not Parrying/Greater Parrying).  With 3 items equipped - +5 insight AC, 30% Additional Melee Threat (Threat stacks, but only with non-like amounts)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Levik%27s_Bracers.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Levik%27s_Bracers.png/420px-Levik%27s_Bracers.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"403\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Levik%27s_Bracers.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This relic of the Silver Flame was supposedly worn by the powerful Paladin Levik. Levik and his brother Lorrik disappeared many years ago when investigating tales of an ancient creature residing beneath Stormreach.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221648\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3330/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20793/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6363/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n109.57%  141.715     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  129.335      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  129.335      1 -total\n 96.84%  125.251      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 36.41%   47.088      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 35.43%   45.828      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 34.35%   44.429      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.17%   42.900      2 Template:InCategory\n 31.77%   41.090      5 Template:Popup\n 24.71%   31.963      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:9112-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221648 and revision id 633220. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
